Package: tidybrregpanel
Title: Snapshots, Synchronisation and Panels for Norway's Business Registry
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sondre", "Skarsten", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sondreskarsten@gmail.com")
Description: The managed-state companion to 'tidybrreg'. Saves dated bulk
    downloads of the Norwegian Central Coordinating Register for Legal
    Entities (Enhetsregisteret) as Hive-partitioned Parquet snapshots,
    keeps a local mirror current from the register's change data capture
    feeds with a persistent changelog, replays updates onto a base
    extract, and derives firm-period panels, entry and exit flows,
    aggregate time series, role-change diffs, annotation and name
    history, director networks and survival data. All retrieval goes
    through 'tidybrreg'; this package adds persistence and analysis.
